# What does not need to leave this machine.
#
# Without this file the CLI uploads roughly 2 GB and the deployment sits at
# status UNKNOWN with a 0ms build while it tries. Previous builds of this
# project took 31-39 seconds; one attempt ran 10 minutes without starting.

# Vercel builds on its own infrastructure, so the local output is dead weight.
.next
node_modules

# The 4K master archive (220 MB) that `npm run images:build` cuts derivatives
# from. The derivatives are committed under public/assets; the originals are
# never served and are deliberately kept out of public/ for exactly that reason.
assets-master

# 153 MB of supplied source material (217 files), including
# client-branded-hold/ — customers' own garment photographs, held back from the
# site on purpose. Nothing outside public/ is served, so these were never
# reachable, but there is no reason to hand them to a third party on every
# deploy either.
asset-pack

# Generated audit output.
reports
